(26). Mp = 167-168 °C. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.71-1.81 (m, 1 H), 2.08
(dd, J =1.71, 8.56 Hz, 1 H), 2.12 (ddd, J = 4.65, 4.89, 10.0 Hz, 1 H),
