1 H), 5.37 (dddd, J = 5.13, 5.14, 10.0, 50.6 Hz, 1 H), 5.79 (s, 2 H),
6.67 (d, J = 8.56 Hz, 1 H), 7.34 (d, J = 8.80 Hz, 2 H), 7.50 (d, J = 8.80
Hz, 1 H), 7.72 (s, 1 H), 7.96 (s, 1 H), 8.01 (s, 1 H), 8.22 (s, 1 H). 13C
NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.67, 166.27, 139.93, 135.43, 134.25, 134.10,
133.63, 132.47, 129.72, 128.91, 128.71, 126.65, 126.40, 124.94, 124.72,
122.14, 119.42, 109.93, 85.23, 59.20, 56.88, 54.33, 48.76, 45.66, 26.42.
LC/MS m/z 553.1 (MH)+. Calcd for C25H21ClF4N4O2S + 0.023 C6H14 + 0.189
