Frederic; Coquerel, Gerard; Saffon, Nathalie; Plaquevent, Jean-Christophe
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2012), 16(2), 277-285

