$DATUM 1-{[1'-(1-Benzyl-1H-1,2,3-triazole-4-yl)ferrocene-1-yl]methyl}-4-(2-methoxyphenyl)piperazine
(13a). A solution of 12a (21.1 mg, 56.8 µmol),
1-(2-methoxyphenyl)piperazine (16.4 mg, 85.2 µmol), and Na(OAc)3BH(25.3
mg, 114 µmol) in anhydrous CH2Cl2 (13 mL) was stirred at room temperature
overnight. The reaction mixture was quenched with saturated aqueous
NaHCO3 and extracted with CH2Cl2. The combined organic layers were dried
(Na2SO4) and evaporated. The residue was purified by flash chromatography
(CH2Cl2:MeOH 98:2) to give 13a as a yellow-orange solid (27.3 mg, 87%
yield); mp 121-125 °C. IR 2939, 2816, 1500, 1454, 1238, 1026, 752 cm-1.
1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ 2.50 (m, 4 H), 3.01 (m, 4 H), 3.16 (s, 2 H),
3.84 (s, 3H), 4.03 (m, 2H), 4.07 (m, 2H), 4.25 (m, 2H), 4.65 (m, 2H),
5.54 (s, 2 H), 6.81-6.85 (m, 1 H), 6.86-6.91 (m, 2 H), 6.94-7.00 (m, 1
H), 7.28-7.32 (m, 2 H), 7.34-7.42 (m, 4 H). 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ
50.39, 52.70, 54.10, 55.33, 57.59, 66.98, 69.17, 69.65, 71.79, 75.75,
82.97, 111.15, 118.21, 118.66, 120.97, 122.83, 127.96, 128.71, 129.16,
134.93, 141.35, 146.73, 152.24. HPLC system A (245 nm) purity 98% (t
R=16.5 min); system D (245 nm) purity >99% (t R=16.7 min). HR-EIMS calcd
m/z for C31H33FeN5O: 547.2035, found 547.2035.
